WEBVTT

00:20.090 --> 00:20.890
You're awake?

00:22.510 --> 00:24.110
I knew it wasn't like this.

00:24.850 --> 00:26.090
You wouldn't do this.

00:31.110 --> 00:32.409
My guess was right.

00:33.640 --> 00:35.970
Shrimpie has two consciousnesses
in his mind.

00:35.970 --> 00:37.760
I don't know why,

00:38.210 --> 00:39.740
but besides his original self,

00:39.740 --> 00:41.520
there's another dark presence inside him—

00:41.520 --> 00:42.280
like

00:43.490 --> 00:45.140
two completely separate personalities.

00:45.140 --> 00:46.170
They

00:46.890 --> 00:49.500
share sight, hearing, and touch,

00:50.700 --> 00:53.000
but they don't know each other's
memories or thoughts.

00:53.000 --> 00:54.130
I call that evil side

00:55.250 --> 00:56.680
"Dark Shrimp."

00:57.600 --> 00:58.840
He's been watching

00:59.380 --> 01:02.040
and controlling
Shrimpie's body all this time.

01:03.380 --> 01:04.310
Most of the time,

01:05.349 --> 01:07.480
Shrimpie is like a prisoner
trapped inside his own mind,

01:07.480 --> 01:08.680
He can't do anything.

01:13.640 --> 01:14.640
Did he go crazy

01:15.070 --> 01:16.280
from snake venom?

01:18.430 --> 01:20.250
It sounds crazy, right?

01:21.570 --> 01:22.940
I would go crazy too.

01:23.370 --> 01:25.200
But he never gave up—

01:25.930 --> 01:27.480
he's been fighting back this whole time.

01:27.480 --> 01:30.200
And this Dark Shrimp seems to be plotting
something huge.

01:30.200 --> 01:31.640
Shrimpie wants to stop him

01:31.640 --> 01:32.590
from killing him.

01:32.590 --> 01:34.830
But if that other consciousness
takes control of his body—

01:34.830 --> 01:37.430
then wouldn't he be unable even
to kill himself?

01:37.430 --> 01:40.690
So how is he supposed to destroy
that other consciousness?

01:40.759 --> 01:42.160
You're Mo Yungao, right?

01:42.430 --> 01:43.680
Your men are all dead.

01:44.729 --> 01:46.330
The Hidden Thread strategy.

01:47.259 --> 01:48.750
I set up a clue,

01:49.070 --> 01:49.729
and

01:50.570 --> 01:53.370
you'll follow this clue
to think and investigate,

01:53.450 --> 01:54.780
and reach a conclusion.

01:55.350 --> 01:56.370
But in reality, both the conclusion

01:56.370 --> 01:58.229
and the entire chain of reasoning

01:58.370 --> 01:59.340
were traps

02:00.290 --> 02:02.090
I laid out for you from the start.

02:03.230 --> 02:04.890
Shrimpie wants to set up a trap

02:05.220 --> 02:06.700
convincing enough that Dark Shrimp
will believe it completely

02:06.700 --> 02:08.229
and end up killing himself.

02:09.130 --> 02:10.930
And when that happens, Shrimpie

02:11.460 --> 02:12.870
will die with him.

02:17.900 --> 02:19.310
But wouldn't Dark Shrimp know everything

02:19.310 --> 02:20.600
Zhang Haixia does?

02:21.410 --> 02:23.270
He can't let him notice anything.

02:24.130 --> 02:25.400
How is that possible?

02:26.520 --> 02:27.530
Now two consciousnesses

02:27.530 --> 02:29.260
are fighting for the same body.

02:29.620 --> 02:32.020
Dark Shrimp wants to wipe out
Shrimpie's consciousness.

02:32.020 --> 02:33.530
Shrimpie needs to let Dark Shrimp

02:33.530 --> 02:35.190
know where his weakness is,

02:35.280 --> 02:37.010
which is the way to wipe him out.

02:37.680 --> 02:38.360
Step two,

02:39.680 --> 02:41.340
Shrimpie pretends not to know

02:41.690 --> 02:42.579
and reacts as usual.

02:42.579 --> 02:45.110
This way, Dark Shrimp
will fall into the trap.

02:45.470 --> 02:47.600
Shrimpie's weakness is me and Mentor.

02:49.530 --> 02:51.140
If his closest ones

02:52.530 --> 02:53.430
betray him

02:54.300 --> 02:55.280
and abandon him,

02:56.680 --> 02:58.270
it's fatal to him.

03:06.420 --> 03:08.740
So this Dark Shrimp
goes around killing people

03:08.740 --> 03:10.600
and intentionally shows it to me.

03:11.620 --> 03:13.630
Sometimes it even pretends those killings
are for my sake.

03:13.630 --> 03:14.910
It's trying to provoke me,

03:14.910 --> 03:16.090
to push me away from him,

03:16.090 --> 03:17.150
to make me hate him—

03:18.370 --> 03:19.970
so Shrimpie will break down.

03:24.720 --> 03:25.720
The cruelest part

03:26.579 --> 03:28.050
of this trap is here.

03:28.870 --> 03:30.740
Obviously it's a trap he set himself,

03:30.740 --> 03:32.400
but he has to be in it too,

03:32.740 --> 03:34.710
and helplessly watch himself

03:36.470 --> 03:37.329
being tortured

03:38.410 --> 03:39.210
until he dies.

03:40.750 --> 03:41.950
He can't do anything.

03:43.390 --> 03:44.420
Then doing this

03:44.740 --> 03:47.090
can only kill Zhang Haixia's
consciousness.

03:47.090 --> 03:49.250
How do we kill Dark Shrimp's
consciousness?

03:49.250 --> 03:51.470
I guess he needs me to cooperate with him.

03:51.470 --> 03:52.300
Then how

03:53.060 --> 03:54.090
do you cooperate?

04:03.920 --> 04:06.440
Now I need to know what Dark Shrimp is,

04:07.930 --> 04:09.220
what his weakness is,

04:09.250 --> 04:10.650
and more of his memories.

04:26.920 --> 04:28.220
Was he crazy just now,

04:28.620 --> 04:30.180
talking nonsense all the time?

04:30.180 --> 04:31.750
But if what he said is true,

04:33.620 --> 04:34.740
then Zhang Haixia

04:37.650 --> 04:38.820
is too pitiful.

04:52.730 --> 04:53.440
Shrimpie!

06:19.010 --> 06:25.620
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

06:25.890 --> 06:28.570
[Episode 33]

07:47.950 --> 07:49.159
These murals

07:50.680 --> 07:53.280
record the history
of the ancient Wupi people.

07:54.130 --> 07:57.060
I should be able to
find the origin of the Dark Shrimp.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.010
These tribes

07:59.030 --> 08:01.960
lived in the southwestern rainforests
year-round,

08:02.240 --> 08:03.480
isolated from the world,

08:03.480 --> 08:05.130
and lived inside the mountains.

08:05.130 --> 08:06.310
Until one day,

08:06.650 --> 08:08.560
their ancestors dug out a huge black stone

08:08.560 --> 08:10.480
from the mountain,

08:10.600 --> 08:11.920
which completely changed the life

08:11.920 --> 08:13.430
of the whole tribe.

08:13.720 --> 08:14.950
To be exact,

08:15.100 --> 08:17.690
this stone somehow affected them,

08:18.250 --> 08:20.210
making them bloody and brutal.

08:20.270 --> 08:22.810
Their physical functions
also became exceptionally strong,

08:22.810 --> 08:25.270
able to heal themselves without treatment,

08:25.300 --> 08:26.700
and even come back to life

08:26.770 --> 08:27.720
after death.

08:28.080 --> 08:29.720
The medicine that made Shrimpie

08:29.720 --> 08:31.410
recover and go crazy

08:32.000 --> 08:33.789
came from this black stone.

08:36.580 --> 08:37.370
No, wait.

08:37.530 --> 08:38.929
Didn't you tell me before

08:39.500 --> 08:41.970
that it was some kind of
worm from jellyfish?

08:42.890 --> 08:44.140
Maybe this thing

08:46.010 --> 08:47.830
originated from here.

08:54.000 --> 08:56.400
The black stones are irradiating the soil,

08:56.750 --> 08:58.590
causing a parasite to mutate.

09:01.240 --> 09:03.050
It's the worm Mentor mentioned,

09:03.870 --> 09:05.170
called Caiyou worms.

09:06.910 --> 09:08.570
All parasitized creatures

09:09.120 --> 09:11.780
will also undergo
varying degrees of mutation.

09:12.100 --> 09:13.700
Among them, infected people

09:13.960 --> 09:15.130
become physically strong

09:15.130 --> 09:16.640
and are called Atianre,

09:19.150 --> 09:19.900
meaning

09:21.770 --> 09:22.960
"the Chosen One".

09:24.480 --> 09:26.680
After the tribe dug out the black stone,

09:27.230 --> 09:29.090
the Caiyou worms began to spread.

09:32.390 --> 09:34.050
It made snakes grow black hair

09:34.940 --> 09:36.470
and speak human language.

09:39.280 --> 09:41.340
It also turned grass into toxic weed.

09:42.950 --> 09:45.950
All parasitized creatures
have one characteristic,

09:48.650 --> 09:51.310
which is that they can hibernate
for a long time.

09:52.120 --> 09:54.580
This is the so-called suspended animation.

09:54.630 --> 09:56.160
So the black-haired snakes

09:57.000 --> 09:59.400
and Twilight Grass all come from Nanqiang.

10:00.390 --> 10:02.940
They mutated
after being infected with worms.

10:02.940 --> 10:04.320
No wonder the Twilight Grass

10:04.320 --> 10:05.600
grows so luxuriantly here.

10:05.600 --> 10:06.890
It seems these ancient Wupi people

10:06.890 --> 10:08.990
discovered these natural phenomena

10:09.080 --> 10:10.210
and made use of them,

10:10.750 --> 10:12.150
using them as weapons

10:12.480 --> 10:13.860
to wipe out other tribes

10:14.100 --> 10:16.500
and continuously expand their territory.

10:17.030 --> 10:17.770
But this tribe

10:17.770 --> 10:19.380
has no records or legends.

10:20.530 --> 10:22.860
It must have disappeared for some reason.

10:28.530 --> 10:29.990
The reason should be here.

10:31.410 --> 10:33.390
In fact, the behavior of these Atianre

10:33.390 --> 10:34.990
was controlled by the worms.

10:38.320 --> 10:41.120
These Atianre seemed to
have two consciousnesses

10:43.940 --> 10:46.620
fighting each other in the same body.

10:50.500 --> 10:51.100
In the end,

10:51.720 --> 10:54.120
they became completely brutal and bloody,

10:54.860 --> 10:57.320
turning into completely different people.

11:04.750 --> 11:06.110
So what you did

11:09.000 --> 11:10.530
was not your intention.

11:19.920 --> 11:21.650
What's more terrifying is that

11:21.870 --> 11:23.400
over time,

11:23.650 --> 11:24.780
these Atianre

11:25.030 --> 11:27.150
would eventually turn into monsters

11:27.700 --> 11:29.500
because of the worm's power.

11:30.010 --> 11:32.610
And all creatures infected
with Caiyou worms,

11:33.600 --> 11:35.650
like mantises infected with
horsehair worms

11:35.650 --> 11:37.390
that must enter the water,

11:37.940 --> 11:39.280
will desperately

11:39.630 --> 11:41.630
want to return to the meteorite.

11:41.950 --> 11:43.880
The occurrence of this phenomenon

11:44.250 --> 11:46.250
made the people in the tribe realize

11:46.530 --> 11:47.270
that Atianre

11:47.270 --> 11:49.520
did not gain any good power.

11:50.080 --> 11:50.790
Its essence

11:51.320 --> 11:52.520
was actually a devil.

11:53.270 --> 11:54.460
So the ancient people

11:54.460 --> 11:55.300
and Atianre

11:56.000 --> 11:57.130
went to war.

12:03.200 --> 12:05.090
The kind ancient Wupi people

12:05.290 --> 12:07.410
were almost all killed
by the cruel Atianre,

12:07.410 --> 12:09.670
the ones who worshipped the black stone.

12:13.070 --> 12:14.730
However, it didn't end there.

12:19.700 --> 12:20.830
The Zhang family...

12:22.320 --> 12:23.710
Our ancestors

12:23.840 --> 12:25.290
noticed something strange in Nanqiang,

12:25.290 --> 12:27.220
and helped the ancient Wupi people

12:27.250 --> 12:29.050
fight against the evil Atianre.

12:29.580 --> 12:31.270
These ghost-like creatures

12:31.910 --> 12:33.840
fled all the way to the black stone.

12:34.790 --> 12:36.860
They, along with the black stone,

12:36.890 --> 12:40.150
were sealed in a Bronze Ball Mechanism
by the Zhang family.

12:42.250 --> 12:43.870
They never appeared again.

12:45.460 --> 12:47.930
An earthquake in Nanqiang 20 years ago

12:48.580 --> 12:50.700
loosened the seal
of the Bronze Ball Mechanism,

12:50.700 --> 12:52.230
and many monsters escaped.

12:53.910 --> 12:55.840
The current chief came to handle it

12:55.860 --> 12:57.370
and sealed it again.

13:01.240 --> 13:02.200
I see.

13:02.990 --> 13:03.940
So Dark Shrimp's goal

13:03.940 --> 13:06.270
is to open the Bronze Ball Mechanism again

13:06.390 --> 13:07.990
and return to the meteorite.

13:08.480 --> 13:09.080
Yes.

13:10.290 --> 13:13.050
Behind Dark Shrimp
is the consciousness of the Caiyou worms.

13:13.050 --> 13:15.390
Opening the Bronze Ball Mechanism
is its instinct.

13:15.390 --> 13:17.920
But once the Bronze Ball Mechanism
is opened,

13:18.030 --> 13:20.790
all the creatures sealed
inside will come out.

13:22.480 --> 13:23.390
If so,

13:24.080 --> 13:25.170
not only Nanqiang,

13:25.500 --> 13:27.360
but everyone will be threatened.

13:28.120 --> 13:29.240
If people are parasitized

13:29.240 --> 13:30.790
by the things on this stone,

13:31.320 --> 13:33.720
they will become bloodthirsty and brutal.

13:42.150 --> 13:44.280
First, it's consciousness invasion.

13:44.960 --> 13:46.420
Eventually, they undergo

13:47.050 --> 13:51.180
a complete mutation into monsters
resembling human-headed centipedes.

14:01.910 --> 14:03.640
Twilight Grass and the Evil God

14:04.940 --> 14:07.670
are enough to turn the outside world
upside down.

14:08.030 --> 14:08.980
Such monsters

14:10.510 --> 14:12.460
had better die underground.

14:34.600 --> 14:35.320
Mentor.

14:38.370 --> 14:39.360
Traitor.

14:43.540 --> 14:46.340
Do you think what you burned
was the real medicine?

15:08.320 --> 15:09.270
Zhang Haixia,

15:11.170 --> 15:12.620
I want to rest.

15:17.150 --> 15:18.480
Help me end this.

15:20.530 --> 15:22.460
I'll wait for you on the other side.

15:49.720 --> 15:51.360
You never give me peace.

15:55.800 --> 15:58.690
Do you think
what you burned was the real medicine?

18:12.660 --> 18:13.290
Shrimpie.

18:19.070 --> 18:19.870
Zhang Hailou,

18:20.940 --> 18:21.880
can you hold on?

18:41.320 --> 18:43.650
Someone is detonating explosives below.

18:44.240 --> 18:45.380
It's Zhang Haixia.

18:45.640 --> 18:47.370
He needs to go deep underground

18:47.790 --> 18:48.940
to find something sealed by

18:48.940 --> 18:50.040
the Zhang ancestors

18:50.040 --> 18:51.840
and release the monster inside.

19:04.820 --> 19:06.160
Where are you going?

19:06.420 --> 19:07.660
I have to stop him.

19:07.980 --> 19:09.110
How will you do that?

19:09.110 --> 19:10.320
I don't know yet.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.160
You go first.

19:34.190 --> 19:35.470
We'll catch up later.

20:01.830 --> 20:03.510
It's dangerous, go!

20:04.900 --> 20:05.970
Hold on to me.

20:07.570 --> 20:09.960
Let go, or you'll die!

20:09.980 --> 20:10.780
Hold on tight.

20:11.250 --> 20:12.710
I won't let go even if I die.

20:15.740 --> 20:17.470
Do you really like me that much?

20:19.510 --> 20:20.460
I do.

20:23.240 --> 20:24.510
Then if we make it out,

20:25.590 --> 20:26.740
will you marry me?

21:18.590 --> 21:19.520
Adjutant Zhang,

21:20.240 --> 21:22.500
is this the secret deep within Nanqiang?

21:22.650 --> 21:24.050
What exactly is in there?

21:25.110 --> 21:27.040
Your mission is already complete.

23:56.510 --> 23:57.700
You're not dead?

23:59.130 --> 24:01.130
How could I bear to die before you do?

24:58.530 --> 25:00.530
You want to use Zhang Haixia's blood

25:01.440 --> 25:03.240
to open the Zhang family's seal.

25:04.960 --> 25:06.310
He is special.

25:09.660 --> 25:11.640
But his willpower was so strong,

25:11.670 --> 25:12.840
and he was so clever,

25:14.480 --> 25:15.920
I have to erase him.

25:17.210 --> 25:18.270
Zhang Hailou.

25:18.850 --> 25:19.920
If you kill me,

25:21.640 --> 25:23.180
he will die too.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.340
You are not him.

25:31.920 --> 25:32.980
Don't call my name.

27:41.270 --> 27:43.130
Do you want to go back to Xiacheng?

27:48.430 --> 27:52.280
♪ The setting sun sinks low into the sea ♪

27:49.560 --> 27:51.220
Do you want to go back to Xiacheng?

27:51.220 --> 27:52.620
Nonsense, of course I do.

27:54.240 --> 27:55.070
Go back to Xiacheng

27:54.560 --> 27:57.200
♪ And the ship goes down into the flames ♪

27:55.550 --> 27:56.680
and find our mentor.

27:57.900 --> 27:58.590
Leave me alone!

27:58.550 --> 28:01.090
♪ You're standing by my side ♪

27:59.300 --> 28:00.390
Follow me.

28:00.440 --> 28:02.760
We'll make a name for ourselves
in Balongzhou.

28:02.760 --> 28:04.270
Then we'll return to Xiacheng in glory

28:04.270 --> 28:05.850
and see Mentor together. Let's go!

28:04.390 --> 28:08.190
♪ Time is like a plague,
devouring yesterday ♪

28:06.270 --> 28:07.700
Zhang Haixia, what are you doing?

28:07.700 --> 28:09.520
I don't want to go back to Xiacheng.

28:09.520 --> 28:11.140
I have nothing left to hold me there.

28:10.330 --> 28:12.840
♪ Yet I've searched through
every archive ♪

28:11.570 --> 28:12.740
Go back in my place.

28:14.590 --> 28:16.290
♪ Filled with endless lies ♪

28:14.700 --> 28:16.300
We still came back together.

28:17.000 --> 28:18.530
You shouldn't have come back to save me.

28:18.300 --> 28:20.240
♪ Even behind a thousand masks ♪

28:19.750 --> 28:21.030
Didn't you save me too?

28:20.650 --> 28:24.790
♪ In a fleeting moment,
I fear a familiar face ♪

28:21.940 --> 28:22.940
You are my junior.

28:23.960 --> 28:25.680
It's my duty to keep you safe.

28:26.350 --> 28:28.180
♪ Fate got one thing wrong ♪

28:28.880 --> 28:32.450
♪ Beneath the setting sun,
our shadows overlap ♪

28:30.080 --> 28:31.530
[Nanyang Maritime Supervisory Office]

28:30.400 --> 28:31.050
Hailou,

28:32.530 --> 28:33.460
one day

28:34.410 --> 28:38.540
♪ The wind carries away the goodbye
we never said ♪

28:34.790 --> 28:36.450
you'll have to act on your own.

28:37.580 --> 28:38.840
I won't be by your side.

28:39.370 --> 28:42.160
♪ The butterfly upon your shoulder ♪

28:40.440 --> 28:42.240
No one will be watching over you.

28:42.980 --> 28:49.150
♪ Stayed with you to witness
this bustling world ♪

28:50.490 --> 28:54.700
♪ Where ruin and decay begin to turn around ♪

28:55.380 --> 28:58.290
♪ A gut feeling of destiny ♪

28:57.860 --> 29:01.490
[iKiwi Film Company]

28:58.870 --> 29:04.930
♪ Bright sunlight, unseen mountains and seas ♪

29:06.110 --> 29:06.900
Thank you.

29:22.370 --> 29:23.610
I'm a little tired.

29:24.300 --> 29:28.380
♪ A reckless faith, blurred from sight ♪

29:30.490 --> 29:33.400
♪ Just to see you once again ♪

29:34.340 --> 29:37.100
♪ The tragedy repeats ♪

29:36.480 --> 29:37.810
My name is Zhang Haixia—

29:38.410 --> 29:40.030
♪ For years, a wanderer of Xianyang ♪

29:38.960 --> 29:40.560
the xia from "xia ke" (hero).

29:40.640 --> 29:44.780
♪ Bound to the prophecy of thrush and snake ♪

29:40.710 --> 29:41.990
And he's Zhang Hailou—

29:42.350 --> 29:44.000
the lou from "louyu" (building).

29:44.000 --> 29:45.860
A tower in spring rain overnight.

29:46.220 --> 29:47.810
Xianyang wanderers, years gone by.

29:46.330 --> 29:48.280
♪ Yet suddenly before my eyes ♪

29:48.690 --> 29:52.430
♪ That hurried goodbye ♪

29:54.650 --> 29:58.800
♪ The opening pages of this story
are woven from deceit ♪

29:59.320 --> 30:02.240
♪ A trial written into fate ♪

30:02.990 --> 30:09.040
♪ Through the mist I search your face—
are you still the same? ♪

30:10.460 --> 30:14.800
♪ The wind carries away the goodbye
we never said ♪

30:15.320 --> 30:18.390
♪ The butterfly upon your shoulder ♪

30:18.780 --> 30:24.700
♪ Stayed with you to witness
this bustling world ♪

31:04.100 --> 31:06.480
[A few days later]

31:35.310 --> 31:38.590
[Soul-Cleansing Temple]

31:53.680 --> 31:54.940
Why are you here?

32:04.700 --> 32:05.880
I was a bit curious,

32:06.770 --> 32:08.030
so I did some research.

32:09.180 --> 32:11.040
What exactly is that black stone,

32:11.950 --> 32:14.080
and what is controlling Zhang Haixia?

32:14.200 --> 32:15.460
Did you find anything?

32:25.330 --> 32:27.440
The strange star is three feet across,

32:27.440 --> 32:29.090
shaped like a round jade,

32:29.110 --> 32:30.710
and colored like black jade.

32:42.720 --> 32:43.610
What does that mean?

32:42.950 --> 32:43.750
[Three Generations—Star Guide Chronicles,
Vol. 1]

32:43.900 --> 32:45.440
I guess that black stone

32:45.550 --> 32:47.010
is very likely a meteorite

32:47.400 --> 32:49.460
that fell from the sky a long time ago.

32:49.810 --> 32:50.680
A meteorite?

32:51.050 --> 32:52.590
Three-corpse bugs
reside in the Big Dipper;

32:52.590 --> 32:55.320
when stars fall,
the bugs enter the mortal realm.

32:58.050 --> 32:59.330
Actually, among these books,

32:59.330 --> 33:00.860
many are about meteorites.

33:03.220 --> 33:04.010
I suspect

33:05.070 --> 33:06.730
the Caiyou worms on the murals

33:07.030 --> 33:09.290
are the alien bugs
brought by the meteorite.

33:09.290 --> 33:11.090
They have parasitic abilities.

33:11.420 --> 33:12.420
When they parasitize

33:12.420 --> 33:13.440
a living creature,

33:13.440 --> 33:15.610
they can also help
repair its damaged body.

33:15.610 --> 33:17.070
But there's a side effect.

33:17.510 --> 33:20.250
That is, they will disrupt
the host's nervous system.

33:20.250 --> 33:21.780
And this new consciousness

33:22.140 --> 33:24.600
gradually erodes the host's original mind,

33:25.610 --> 33:27.270
eventually becoming
the new dominant consciousness.

33:27.270 --> 33:28.290
Like

33:28.980 --> 33:30.110
a cuckoo in the nest?

33:34.900 --> 33:35.530
Then,

33:36.250 --> 33:38.960
Zhang Haixia insisting on
returning to Nanqiang earlier

33:38.960 --> 33:40.360
was also because of this?

33:40.400 --> 33:42.400
This might have something to do with

33:43.440 --> 33:44.940
the homing instinct of these alien bugs.

33:44.940 --> 33:46.640
Perhaps these alien bugs have

33:47.900 --> 33:49.900
a survival instinct to return home.

33:50.200 --> 33:51.030
That's why

33:51.030 --> 33:53.160
he wanted to come to Nanqiang so badly.

34:01.440 --> 34:03.380
Where are you going? I'll go with you.

34:03.380 --> 34:04.180
To the toilet.

34:04.480 --> 34:05.680
Do you want to follow?

34:06.850 --> 34:07.450
By the way,

34:07.510 --> 34:09.030
the black-haired snake
you mentioned earlier,

34:09.030 --> 34:10.460
did it get on you by accident,

34:10.460 --> 34:13.190
or was it deliberately arranged
by Zhang Haixia?

34:16.280 --> 34:17.000
Who knows.

34:19.260 --> 34:21.320
I'm getting married. Are you coming?

34:21.380 --> 34:22.280
Are you coming?

34:26.510 --> 34:28.969
-A happy marriage and kids soon!
-Kids soon!

34:32.360 --> 34:34.150
Wish you happiness!

34:42.860 --> 34:43.590
Happy.

34:43.590 --> 34:45.300
Thank you.

34:46.480 --> 34:47.300
One more round!

34:47.300 --> 34:48.110
One more round!

34:48.110 --> 34:49.010
One more round!

34:50.440 --> 34:51.300
One more round!

34:51.460 --> 34:52.370
One more round!

34:52.670 --> 34:53.420
One more round!

34:53.370 --> 34:59.290
♪ The past fades into traces on the page ♪

34:55.000 --> 34:56.440
Kids soon!

34:57.070 --> 34:58.480
Congratulations.

34:58.940 --> 34:59.670
From now on,

35:00.460 --> 35:06.240
♪ A silent breeze
brushes past that lingering warmth ♪

35:00.570 --> 35:03.480
you have to carry me on your back
for the rest of your life.

35:03.480 --> 35:04.210
Definitely.

35:06.960 --> 35:07.690
Let the feast begin.

35:07.560 --> 35:13.620
♪ In this fleeting world,
I long for a moment of vivid life ♪

35:08.210 --> 35:08.630
Let the feast begin.

35:08.630 --> 35:09.110
Let the feast begin.

35:09.110 --> 35:10.240
Let the feast begin.

35:14.580 --> 35:19.370
♪ I may have a chance to open a door ♪

35:19.940 --> 35:20.500
Come.

35:20.500 --> 35:20.880
Here.

35:20.650 --> 35:27.350
♪ Where love and wish
meet in a fleeting moment ♪

35:20.960 --> 35:22.030
Happy wedding!

35:22.030 --> 35:22.860
Cheers.

35:22.860 --> 35:23.730
Drink up!

35:27.920 --> 35:34.220
♪ There's no need to ask questions
in the maze ♪

35:34.010 --> 35:34.760
Eat, eat

35:34.820 --> 35:37.190
♪ The world's bustle ♪

35:34.960 --> 35:36.380
Come, eat up.

35:36.500 --> 35:37.230
Don't be shy.

35:37.630 --> 35:42.630
♪ For now, a few of us under the same roof ♪

35:38.260 --> 35:39.390
Let's go over there.

35:43.620 --> 35:49.310
♪ And the story has come to an end ♪

35:44.550 --> 35:45.300
Snake charmer,

35:45.300 --> 35:46.230
shouldn't we have a drink?

35:46.230 --> 35:47.340
Absolutely.

35:47.370 --> 35:47.690
Cheers.

35:47.690 --> 35:48.150
Cheers.

35:48.980 --> 35:49.840
One more drink.

35:51.320 --> 35:53.250
Aren't you going to ask him to stay?

35:59.650 --> 36:00.650
I didn't expect

36:00.830 --> 36:02.490
everything he said to be true.

36:02.780 --> 36:04.070
He had a very good,

36:04.480 --> 36:05.570
great friend.

36:04.810 --> 36:08.010
♪ Clouds drift and fade just a few years ♪

36:06.710 --> 36:08.280
It's hard to imagine what Zhang Haixia

36:08.280 --> 36:09.490
has been through.

36:10.690 --> 36:11.990
It must be painful.

36:11.880 --> 36:15.100
♪ Mortal world grass
regrows after parting ♪

36:13.800 --> 36:15.400
The one left behind at the end

36:16.980 --> 36:18.110
suffers the most.

36:26.900 --> 36:29.830
[Years later]

36:56.020 --> 36:57.680
There's trouble in Nanqiang.

36:58.000 --> 36:59.600
We need to work together.

37:00.450 --> 37:03.450
I'm looking forward to
fighting alongside you again.

37:45.840 --> 37:47.980
Mentor, Zhang Haichan
is the one who made the mistake.

37:47.360 --> 37:49.080
[Zhang Haichan] [Zhang Haidou]

37:48.010 --> 37:49.420
Why are you punishing me?

37:49.780 --> 37:50.900
You are the senior brother.

37:50.900 --> 37:52.500
Her mistake is your mistake.

37:52.690 --> 37:54.210
You need to protect your junior sister,
got it?

37:54.210 --> 37:55.800
I am younger than her.

37:56.400 --> 37:58.730
Who told you to become a disciple earlier?

37:59.510 --> 38:01.230
I must have sinned in my past life

38:01.230 --> 38:02.730
to have a junior sister like you.

38:02.730 --> 38:04.070
In the future when I go on missions,

38:04.070 --> 38:05.940
I will definitely stay far away from you.

38:05.940 --> 38:07.870
I want to stay far away from you too.

38:07.870 --> 38:09.610
I want to stay far away from you.

38:09.630 --> 38:10.300
-I want to
-Come on, keep up!

38:10.300 --> 38:12.550
-stay far away from you.
-I want to stay far away from you.

38:12.550 --> 38:14.670
-I want to stay far away from you.
-I want to stay far away from you.

38:14.670 --> 38:15.380
Stay away from me!

38:15.380 --> 38:18.980
-I want to stay far away from you.
-I want to stay far away from you.

38:24.760 --> 38:26.090
Haichan, Haidou,

38:27.550 --> 38:29.280
don't forget what I taught you.

38:29.340 --> 38:31.290
Greet them properly
when we see them later.

38:31.290 --> 38:31.850
Okay.

38:39.500 --> 38:41.090
Greetings, chief!

38:41.190 --> 38:41.840
Chief.

38:53.710 --> 38:55.550
Something's happened deep in Nanqiang.

38:55.550 --> 38:56.680
It's time to set off.

38:56.760 --> 38:57.820
Let's set off.

39:55.670 --> 39:59.850
[Wushan Residence]

40:04.160 --> 40:08.140
[Wu Xie]

40:05.800 --> 40:07.490
The story of the Southern Archives

40:07.490 --> 40:09.220
has temporarily come to an end.

40:09.860 --> 40:10.920
After watching it,

40:10.960 --> 40:11.960
I am just like you,

40:12.130 --> 40:14.060
unable to calm down for a long time.

40:16.170 --> 40:20.790
[Closing Report: Nanyang
Balai Yazhou Salt-Alkali Lake]

40:16.210 --> 40:17.260
My soul

40:17.480 --> 40:18.400
seems to have stayed in

40:18.400 --> 40:19.880
that sunny Nanyang,

40:20.280 --> 40:22.170
that magnificent Bailejing,

40:20.940 --> 40:26.350
[Closing Report: Nanqiang Bailejing]

40:22.420 --> 40:23.620
unwilling to return.

40:26.350 --> 40:33.190
[Closing Report: Panhua Reef]

40:40.460 --> 40:41.340
Has their story

40:41.610 --> 40:42.730
ended here?

40:46.970 --> 40:47.910
Or,

40:49.030 --> 40:50.770
will we be able to meet again?

41:00.900 --> 41:01.530
I think,

41:02.050 --> 41:04.010
in the process of digging into the past,

41:04.010 --> 41:05.740
we will definitely meet again.

41:05.940 --> 41:08.340
I will definitely see their legends again.

41:09.440 --> 41:10.090
However,

41:10.550 --> 41:12.880
do you still want to keep
watching with me?

41:17.150 --> 41:27.190
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]
